  "releaseNotes": "# Changelog\n\nAll notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.\n\n## [Huskui.Avalonia@v1.4.0] - 2026-07-03\n\n### 🚀 Features\n\n- 新增导航菜单组件并重构Gallery应用\n- *(Core)* Add NavigationView control\n- *(Core)* Expose Navigate and refine pane chrome\n- *(NavigationView)* Add NavigationView control\n\n### 🐛 Bug Fixes\n\n- *(Core)* Restore Dark Gray10 color value\n- *(Core)* Address review findings on NavigationView\n\n### 🚜 Refactor\n\n- *(gallery)* 重构菜单服务与清理冗余代码\n\n<!-- generated by git-cliff -->",
